error[L0517]: the closure that `counters!` returns cannot change `start`
 --> check/changed_by_closure_inside_returned_value.knv:2:15
  |
2 |   (vec (fn () (set! start (+ start 1)) start)))
  |               ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ this changes the caller's value of `start`
  |
  = note: the closure would keep a `mut` borrow of the caller's value for as long as it lives, so the caller could not read that value again
  = help: to give the closure a value of its own, start `counters!` with `(local count start)` and use `count` in the closure

error[L0509]: this closure is `FnMut`, but the parameter accepts `Fn`
