  |
2 |   (vec (fn () (set! start (+ start 1)) start)))
  |        -------------^^^^^--------------------
  |        |            |
  |        |            `start` changes here
  |        this closure is passed here
  |
  = help: `this function` calls this closure as `Fn`, but it changes `start`

